[I] Trace converter and read/write library

[T] Babeltrace 2 is an open-source trace manipulation toolkit from EfficiOS,
[T] best known for reading, converting and writing Common Trace Format (CTF)
[T] traces such as those of LTTng. It consists of the babeltrace2
[T] command-line tool, the libbabeltrace2 library with a plugin system for
[T] sources, filters and sinks, and Python bindings.

[U] https://www.efficios.com/babeltrace

[A] Babeltrace Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS NO-LTO.gcc

[V] 2.1.2
[L] MIT

